{"v":4,"catch":"用方塊親手建造你的島嶼！","desc":"搭建方塊，發揮創意，放松身心，享受樂趣^^\n\n在建造島嶼模式中重新打造三組島嶼，或透過島嶼編輯器建造並分享你的獨特島嶼！\n\n大量方塊任你挑選，島嶼的大小由你決定，讓想象力馳騁天際！\n\n無論是可愛的山間小屋，雄偉的城堡、蔥郁的森林……還是其他的奇思妙想，一切由你來創造。","publisher":"Silesia Games","release":"2025-02-20","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","模擬","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","葡萄牙文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.7GB / Switch 0.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/00df3a6c114eb0d752cc98ce5eee5236f0cbfe78d85fb7316aa3c3ab981ab8de.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c2ed8a2b77bb3064296e29b052ccf8c3ef1f38b2003e7138a408ed7b1d793c5a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3c24469d983eb043ea442fca66af3ccd1af0ddf59cb62e1ac95fb3402ef84a65.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a5d9fee13057012317e75034f6bdcca9c2d734521b2a59dd16ec8e4229d1afb8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/790ab42b65b254319dd8ebfb8ae335f7312ffb818c2bbd46ca1018c7c19f4438.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3493fcb02bcbc3f9fe9e07d9cd095735e7af083365d83fe2c0e8762f1dcc91ff.jpg"],"titleId":"01002a0019084000","dlc":[]}